+## In the ASC Audit pages
 
-## In a page
+Upload `dist/risk-wasm.bundle.js` to the database as a file resource and
+include it on each form before the page script:
 
 ```html
-<script src="https://nela-risk-model.example.org/risk-r.js"></script>
-<script>
-  riskR.start({ modelUrl: 'https://nela-risk-model.example.org/model/' })
